        invitation: ['Brothers, come. Are you worshiping, or are you attending? The mouth. The heart. You can tell the difference if you will. If the Spirit is pressing you, do not wait for a better feeling. Answer him.', 'Brothers, come. What part of your worship is only a place and a habit? Come in truth this week. If the Spirit is pressing you, do not wait for a better feeling. Answer him.'],
        closingPrayer: ['Father, thank you for your Word. Plant this truth in us for the week we actually have. Give us courage to obey and mercy when we fail. Through Jesus Christ. Amen.', 'Lord, we have heard you. Now keep us from leaving this room unchanged. Make us doers of the Word. In Jesus’ name. Amen.'],
